Z||000000||fieroshop||12-25-1999||09:37 AM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Well looks like the Holidays turned topsy turvy for me. The wife and I decided to split up and go our separate ways. So I have to move and that means the shop also as the shop is behind the house, I guess that's life.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> But the Good news is that I have found a 2 acre site to move the shop to and I will be able to expand. The expansion that is planned is a full parts store and also we will be doing kit car conversions. We will also offer all sorts of goodies and will be manufacturing many new products in the coming months. (Who said that splitting up is Bad)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by fieroshop (edited 12-25-1999).]||||reg||6
Z||000001||Cooter||12-25-1999||10:57 AM||||Merry Christmas????? I am sorry to hear about your situation. My brother is in the middle of a divorce and their 2 year old baby is paying the price. I hope everything works out for you.||||reg||1
