Z||000009||fieroshop||12-30-1999||02:00 AM||||Well it seems that my wife decided that she did not want me to leave so I will give her another chance. I was the one that wanted to lieave and so she got mad and said get out and then changed her mind. But she did give me the shop lock,stock and barrel. Thank God that she is no longer part of the shop. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
